text = "Controls:
• WASD / Arrows: Move avatar (solids block)
• Left Click/Drag: Paint material
• Right Click: Erase cells
• E: Dig at avatar
• F: Place material at avatar
• Space: Toggle simulation
• N: Step single tick
• R: Rebuild cave
• F1: Open material demo
• F5 / F9: Save / Load"
